<section class="core-services-section">
  <h2 class="sub-heading">Complete Garage Door Services at Lake Isabella</h2>
  <p class="core-services-intro">
    Lakefront living puts unique demands on garage door systems. Here's what Lake Isabella homeowners and cottage owners count on us for:
  </p>

  <div class="core-services-grid">

    <a href="/services/broken-springs" class="core-services-card spring reveal-on-scroll">
      <h3>Broken Spring Replacement</h3>
      <p>Springs fail without warning—often right when you're trying to load the boat trailer on the first warm weekend of the year. When a spring snaps, the door isn't going anywhere on its own. We carry high-cycle replacement springs, replace both at once so you're not in this situation again next season, and balance the door before we leave. Most Lake Isabella spring calls completed same-day.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/services/door-repair" class="core-services-card repair">
      <h3>General Door Repair</h3>
      <p>Off-track doors, snapped cables, worn rollers, bent tracks, damaged panels—whatever it is, we'll find it and fix it. Lakefront properties can present unique access situations and we're used to that. No drama, no guesswork—just an accurate diagnosis and a solid repair that holds up through the season.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/services/opener-repair" class="core-services-card opener">
      <h3>Opener Repair & Installation</h3>
      <p>An opener that sat all winter can be temperamental come spring. Grinding, reversing, remote issues, or complete failure—we service all major brands and can install a new smart opener with Wi-Fi control if it's time to upgrade. Smart openers are especially useful for lake properties where you want to let someone in remotely or check if you left the door open.</p>
    </a>
<!--
    <a href="/services/new-door-installation" class="core-services-card installation">
      <h3>New Door Installation</h3>
      <p>Lakefront homes are an investment, and a worn-out garage door undercuts the whole property. We install quality residential doors in every style—traditional, carriage house, modern—in steel, wood, or composite. Insulated options are worth considering for seasonal properties that see temperature extremes. We handle everything including removal of your old door.</p>
    </a>
-->
    <a href="/services/maintenance" class="core-services-card maintenance">
      <h3>Seasonal Tune-Up & Maintenance</h3>
      <p>Garage doors on seasonal properties take a beating—months of dormancy followed by heavy use all summer. An annual tune-up before or after the season keeps springs lubricated, cables tensioned, rollers moving smoothly, and the opener dialed in. It's the kind of thing that prevents the emergency call on Memorial Day weekend when you'd rather be on the water.</p>
    </a>

